WEBVTT

01:11:36.617 --> 01:11:39.035
Now let's catch up
to that truck.

01:11:46.418 --> 01:11:49.045
Guys! Guys! Woody's riding R.C.

01:11:49.129 --> 01:11:51.255
-What?
-And Buzz is with him!

01:11:55.552 --> 01:11:56.678
It is Buzz!

01:11:56.762 --> 01:11:58.763
Woody was telling the truth.

01:11:58.847 --> 01:12:02.225
-What have we done?
-Great! Now I have guilt.
